							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "In memory, the image now has {{gtExample:GtMemoryMetrics class>>totalImageSizeInMemory|label=#humanReadableIsqByteSize}}: all objects after a full garbage collection, including the objects created by the UI and the user. Saving the image now would write roughly this size."
						},
